Z||000015||superXmotorsports||02-16-2000||06:45 PM||||I can sympathize with him being busy, but like Dan-O I've NEVER had my calls returned.  I contacted them on 3 different occasions in the last 2 years and they've never gotten back to me.  Most recently I called and left a message about a Fiero part that Justin at the Fiero Store said Kickhill may have but alas no phone call!  As a fellow Fiero business I would like to work with him - but I've had terrible luck!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  SXM.||||reg||1
